  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>Tokenized stocks distributed value rose 13.0% over 30D:</strong> Tokenized equity distributed value at $2.84B (13.0% higher over 30D) shows the early lane still adding balance sheet on a small set of platforms. Related: <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxOU2xfR01iSlZxREpKX2JhSUtLTGJZbzUyb1pwOFdJYnZfQmNuTGJPWEVOTkxwaW03aFo5UXVsZXg1XzQzY05zLW5VTk9hNkZHRllUdXV4TmtORWJaV0N1aW1PR2hhVGdkYURSNjZTbkZzdHZhcDBPSUlERnEyeUl1bHoyamFjcmFYenRPY2pkaUJveU5ZTHhuX2VyUUZ1a2RILUJxSGVfUmx5bjV0NVZxcGtvUzNDQ1ZPR05VcVgxTWNNbTg?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The SEC targets double recordkeeping in tokenized stock markets with sweeping transfer agent overhaul</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Tokenized stocks remain an early-stage lane:</strong> liquidity and scale are still concentrated in a small set of platforms/networks. Related: <a href=\"https://thedefiant.io/news/tradfi-and-fintech/the-amc-fight-turned-into-an-industry-argument-over-which-tokenized-stock-model-wins\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The AMC Fight Turned Into An Industry Argument Over Which Tokenized Stock Model Wins</a> (The Defiant).</li><li><strong>Tokenized equities remain an early access market:</strong> Liquidity and scale stay concentrated until broker distribution and custody plumbing can support broader trading. Related: <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxPa09iRW91a1pma2lEeTMyV0kzVWZ6WktEU2lINWwxaFdTS0xkWHhwNnFBNXhuZ2lpX3NzTXZuS3d0VmZ6UlNxc0NMUjBGVUVVRldKZS1OWTNaVF9MUXZ6bFR1R0RuU25iX0JXNDJiOWJGR21yem0tOUJEU2dlRUxLM3F1LUtPQTNRMjh5Vm9DSmpBMEQtUGVWNmhOS3VzemxQNkZzSFRDd2xoRmlsd01vZDN2NVhXLWJ1TmtYdUZwUDM1Y00?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Monument Bank delays retail tokenized deposits while onboarding custody partner</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Regulatory framing still decides product access:</strong> Securities and broker-rule constraints often set the pace more than listing count, so near-term share stays tied to venues that can actually distribute products. Related: <a href=\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/anchorage-digital-adds-institutional-access-to-frgmnts-fusd-stablecoin?utm_source=rss_feed&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Anchorage Digital adds institutional access to Frgmnt\u2019s fUSD stablecoin</a> (CoinTelegraph).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
